 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "D1",
   "start": 3.95,
   "end": 11.801,
   "caption": "This is Ingot, running live on Monad testnet. Everything you're about to see is a real transaction, from a brand-new wallet."
  },
  {
   "id": "D2",
   "start": 12.251,
   "end": 18.629,
   "caption": "Ingot turns the price of renting a GPU into a market you can trade, hedge, and borrow against."
  },
  {
   "id": "D3",
   "start": 24.588,
   "end": 26.828,
   "caption": "Open the terminal, and connect a wallet."
  },
  {
   "id": "D4",
   "start": 29.599,
   "end": 40.948,
   "caption": "This is the index: the on-demand price of one H100 GPU-hour, published on-chain. Every print carries its methodology, and the quotes and venues behind it."
  },
  {
   "id": "D5",
   "start": 42.698,
   "end": 49.226,
   "caption": "The wallet is empty, so the faucet sends it test USDC. One transaction, confirmed in a block."
  },
  {
   "id": "D6",
   "start": 55.892,
   "end": 59.583,
   "caption": "Post $20,000 as margin. Approve, then deposit."
  },
  {
   "id": "D7",
   "start": 66.32,
   "end": 77.819,
   "caption": "Now, go long 10 lots: 7,300 GPU-hours. Before you sign, the ticket shows your fill, the margin it locks, the fee, and the worst price the contract will accept."
  },
  {
   "id": "D8",
   "start": 79.16,
   "end": 83.342,
   "caption": "Filled, in one block. The position is live, and marked to the index."
  },
  {
   "id": "D10",
   "start": 87.025,
   "end": 99.676,
   "caption": "Now, the reason this market exists. On the credit desk, a GPU operator borrows against next month's revenue: 100,000 GPU-hours, at the index rate, with the minimum margin."
  },
  {
   "id": "D11",
   "start": 103.549,
   "end": 109.992,
   "caption": "One click draws the loan, and opens its hedge, in the same transaction. All of it happens, or none of it does."
  },
  {
   "id": "D12",
   "start": 111.742,
   "end": 121.939,
   "caption": "Now drag the settlement rate. Unhedged, the lender's recovery falls through the debt. Hedged, it holds at every rate. Every point is read straight from the contract."
  },
  {
   "id": "D13",
   "start": 130.715,
   "end": 138.203,
   "caption": "On the other side of every trade is the underwriter vault. It quotes both ways off the mark, and earns the spread and the fees."
  },
  {
   "id": "D14",
   "start": 142.244,
   "end": 146.361,
   "caption": "Deposit $10,000, and the vault mints shares at the current share price."
  },
  {
   "id": "D15",
   "start": 153.54,
   "end": 158.916,
   "caption": "Back on the terminal, closing is one click, and the profit or loss lands straight in margin."
  },
  {
   "id": "D16",
   "start": 173.6,
   "end": 177.547,
   "caption": "Ingot. Compute, priced and hedged. Live now, on Monad testnet."
  }
 ],
